- * appear to vanish. This imports them ONCE — gated by a sentinel next to the kernel
- * DB (`<gitCommonDir>/forge/beads-import.json`, shared across worktrees like the DB)
- * — idempotently, announcing on stderr only so `--json` stdout stays a pure contract.
- * NEVER throws: the safety net must never break the command it rides on.
